Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Go sources of libaql, the front end of the query language AQL
 libaql reads the text of one AQL statement for an MCP server. AQL is a
 small SQL dialect: SELECT and DESCRIBE read, INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE
 change one record. The library returns the statement, or an error whose
 message says what to write instead. This package has the sources of the
 Go module github.com/mge1512/aql/go/aql; there is no executable.
